  "term": "Depakene",
  "definition": "Depakene is valproic acid, a synthetic chemical related to propylpentanoic acid that has antiepileptic effects. In the brain, it appears to raise levels of gamma-aminobutyric acid (GABA), and it has also been studied for possible antitumor and antiangiogenesis activity.",
